1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kilde: Wikipeida: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilhelm_Thagaard: Wilhelm Thagaard (31 October 1890 – 1 December 1970) was a Norwegian jurist and civil servant. He was born in Kristiania. He chaired Prisdirektorate
2 CONC t over two periods, a total of twenty years. During the occupation of Norway by Nazi Germany Thagaard was a member of "Kretsen", a leading body of the Norwegian Resistance Movement. A special law from 1945, "Lex Thagaard", was nam
2 CONC ed after him. He represented Norway internationally in OEEC, OECD and GATT.
