2 CONT
2 CONT Lista II.54.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lista II.54.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christen Toresen Skjoldnes was born at Skjoldnes, Lista, Vest Agder., Norway. He married Anna Salvesdtr. He married Margrethe Jansdtr Jent (21617) in 1711 at Skien. He died before 1748 at Mosvoll, Lista, Vest Agder., Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margrethe Jansdtr Jent. As of 1711, her married name was Toresen. She married Christen Toresen Skjoldnes, son of Tore Jonsen Vintland and Otlu Holgersdtr Mosvoll, in 1711 at Skien. She had:Cornelius Tønnes baptized døpt dom. 3.p.t
2 CONC rin 1712 Mosvold
2 CONT
2 CONT sponsors:  1. Søren Christensen, 2. Christoffer Lem, 3. Mons. Iver Lem, 4. Jens Mosvold, 5. --- kone Elisabeth Tholiops, 6. og Madamoselle Ingebor Holst.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margrethe. She died before 1754 at Mosvoll, Lista, Vest Agder., Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/e54e16e46d039acfdc0d7ff7d4315ef5?page=57&searchText=Jansdtr
