2 CONT Herad 440, 451,
2 CONT
2 CONT Feda 469.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lista I.545.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lista II. 765
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunhild Jonsdtr Nordhassel øvre was born at Nordhassel øvre, lista, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Steener Nilsen Vigmostad, son of Nils Olsen Vigmostad øvre. She married Ånen Olsen Briseid, son of Ola Ånensen Briseid, circa 1680
2 CONC . She died circa 1682 at Eigeland, Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. She nevnt Lista II. 765-.. I. 545.
2 CONT
2 CONT Steener Nilsen Vigmostad married Gunhild Jonsdtr Nordhassel øvre, daughter of Jon Reiersen Håland and Johanne Olsdtr Fjelse. He was born circa 1625 at Vigmostad, Vest Agder, Norway. He appeared on the census of between 1664 and 16
2 CONC 66 at Eigeland. He died circa 1674 at Eigeland, Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Lista II. 765-.I. 545-.919.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Fra Listaboka II s. 767 og 765. Gift to ganger. Først med Ånen Buland og siden med Steinar Eigeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/39943/6331
